# Next.js Build Ignore File
# Reduces compilation time by ignoring unnecessary files

# Test files
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx

# Demo and example files
**/examples/**
**/demo/**

# Documentation
**/*.md
**/docs/**
**/*.MD

# Development only
**/*.stories.tsx
**/*.storybook.tsx

# Large data files that don't need compilation
**/data/**/*.json
**/data/**/*.csv
**/data/**/*.xlsx
